<title>USA: PS Financial plans share buy-back.</title>
<headline>PS Financial plans share buy-back.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>PS Financial Inc said Tuesday it has notified the Office of Thrift Supervision that it intends to repurchase about four percent of its outstanding shares of common stock in the open market over a six-month period.</p>
<p>The shares will be used for its recognition and retention plan, it added.  </p>
<p>If the Office of Thrift Supervision does not object, the shares will be purchased at prevailing market prices from time to time depending on market conditions.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
